For NVIDIA Orin AGX platform:
The arducam 12MP camera module is supported, link as below:
https://www.arducam.com/arducam-12mp-multi-camera-kit-for-nvidia-jetson-agx-orin.html

<1> Connect arducam 12MP camera module with J509 of NVIDIA Orin AGX platform

<2> Deploy camera_overrides.isp file

Download a debian package from arducam 12MP camera release link as below:
https://github.com/ArduCAM/MIPI_Camera/releases/download/v0.0.1-agx-orin/arducam-nvidia-l4t-kernel-t234-agx-orin-5.15.148-tegra-36.4.3-20250224115510_arm64_imx477.deb
And then unpack the debian package with below command:
	$ dpkg-deb -xv <file.deb> <path to extract>
