root@<MACHINE>:~# gst-launch-1.0 filesrc location=<filename.mp4> ! decodebin name=dec ! nvvidconv ! nvegltransform ! nveglglessink

7.5.3 Video encode
------------------

<1> Capture data from camera and encode with below command:

Only record data:
root@<MACHINE>:~# gst-launch-1.0 nvarguscamerasrc ! \
                                       'video/x-raw(memory:NVMM), width=(int)1920, height=(int)1080, \
                                       format=(string)NV12, framerate=(fraction)30/1' ! nvvidconv ! \
                                       'video/x-raw(memory:NVMM), format=I420' ! nvv4l2h264enc ! \
                                       h264parse ! qtmux ! filesink location=output.mp4 -e

Record data and preview:
root@<MACHINE>:~# gst-launch-1.0 nvarguscamerasrc ! tee name=t ! \
                                       'video/x-raw(memory:NVMM), width=(int)1920, height=(int)1080, \
                                       format=(string)NV12, framerate=(fraction)30/1' ! queue ! nvvideoconvert ! nvegltransform ! nveglglessink t. ! queue ! nvvidconv ! \
                                       'video/x-raw(memory:NVMM), format=I420' ! nvv4l2h264enc ! \
                                       h264parse ! qtmux ! filesink location=output.mp4 -e

<2> Play the recorded video clip with below command:

root@<MACHINE>:~# gst-launch-1.0 filesrc location=./output.mp4 ! decodebin name=dec ! nvvidconv ! nvegltransform ! nveglglessink

7.5.4 Audio decode
------------------

